<section class="system-shell rank-{{system.rank}} combat-shell"><div class="system-panel"><h2>{{actor.name}} — {{titlecase system.rank}}</h2><h3>Foundry Encounter</h3>{{#if encounter.active}}<p>Round {{encounter.round}} · Turn {{encounter.turn}} · Active: {{encounter.combatantName}}</p><p>{{#if encounter.participant}}{{#if encounter.current}}Your combatant is active{{else}}Waiting for your turn{{/if}}{{else}}This actor is not a combatant{{/if}}</p>{{#if isGM}}{{#if encounterStarted}}<button type="button" data-action="next-turn">Advance Encounter Turn</button>{{else}}<button type="button" data-action="start-combat">Start Foundry Encounter</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{else}}<p>No active Foundry encounter. Add combatants using the native Combat Tracker.</p>{{/if}}<h3>Action Score: {{score}}</h3><button type="button" data-action="start-score">Roll New Action Score (d20)</button><p>Starts a new score; turn order and score bonuses are deferred.</p><p>Life Force: {{system.resources.lifeForce.value}}/{{system.resources.lifeForce.max}}</p><p>Mana: {{system.resources.mana.value}}/{{system.resources.mana.max}}</p><p>Stamina: {{system.resources.stamina.value}}/{{system.resources.stamina.max}}</p><p>Normal Shield: {{system.resources.shield.value}} | Armor: {{system.resources.armor.value}}</p><button type="button" data-cost="2">Move (2)</button><h3>Favorite Abilities</h3>{{#each abilities as |a|}}<div class="list-row">{{a.name}} <button type="button" data-cost="{{a.system.actionCost}}" data-ability-id="{{a.id}}">Spend {{a.system.actionCost}} Action Score / {{a.system.manaCost}} Mana / {{a.system.staminaCost}} Stamina</button></div>{{else}}<p>Mark abilities as favorites to display them here.</p>{{/each}}</div></section>